From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 05:06:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(property-site): rebuild premium property experience and
 enforce Hebrew UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Public property-detail page (PropertyMarketingPage) — presentation + a HARD
Hebrew-only P0. No new queries, no business-logic changes, dynamic brand tokens.

P0 HEBREW-ONLY:
- New canonical resolver src/lib/property-marketing/presentation.ts (pure,
  dependency-free): resolvePropertyFeature(s)/Type/Status map raw enums →
  Hebrew. Human QA showed raw English leaking from the free-form features
  column (air_conditioning, renovated, upgraded_kitchen, solar_heater,
  pandor_doors, bars). The resolver maps the canonical PROPERTY_FEATURE_KEYS +
  common import aliases/spelling variants; an UNKNOWN internal/English
  (snake_case / ASCII-only) token is NEVER exposed — features drop it, type/
  status fall back to a safe Hebrew value. Wired into data.ts featureList and
  the page's type label (removed the partial inline TYPE_LABEL).
- Test scripts/fd-closure-tests/property-presentation.test.ts (10 cases)
  guards the presentation boundary: known enums → Hebrew; raw tokens can never
  leak (no ASCII-only label survives). Not a brittle whole-bundle grep.

VISUAL:
- Hero: title 34/52, price 44/56, spec numbers 30px, larger CTAs.
- על הנכס: editorial 18px story column + facts as large numbers (22px) rather
  than a tiny table.
- Features: 48px icon tiles, 26px glyphs (expanded FeatIcon with ac/renovated/
  bars/door/kitchen/bed/view/eye/building/sun), 16px labels.
- Agent: trust moment — 128/144px portrait, 24px name, role/office, actions.
- Viewing CTA: "מעוניינים לראות את הנכס?" 32/46, elevated form card.

